## . [ios-app] Mobile tools=xcode,cocoapods,fastlane
build                    Build          inferred low    safe        .          xcodebuild -project App.xcodeproj -scheme App -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 16' build :: Build the App scheme for the iOS Simulator
test                     Testing        inferred low    safe        .          xcodebuild -project App.xcodeproj -scheme App -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 16' test :: Run App tests in the iOS Simulator
pods                     Other          inferred medium safe        .          pod install :: Install CocoaPods dependencies
ios:test                 Testing        declared exact  safe        .          bundle exec fastlane ios test :: Run unit tests
ios:beta                 Release        declared exact  external    .          bundle exec fastlane ios beta :: Ship a build to TestFlight
